    "description": "Three-unit building in tremendous Inner Richmond location with full-floor owner's unit delivered vacant. Excellent opportunity to reside in a top floor 3-bedroom and 2-bathroom unit while receiving rent from the other two units. Modern floor plan with bedrooms at the rear, including one ensuite, and kitchen/living/dining areas at the front. The spacious rooms are well-lit with large windows and skylights. Move-in ready with new flooring and fresh paint. This unit also features lots of storage, a fireplace, and washer & dryer hookups. An available garage parking space and a bonus office at the rear of the garage make this home even more attractive! A 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit and a 1-bedroom, 1-bathroom unit are tenant occupied on the second floor. The property has a 3-car garage with laundry machines and a flat backyard with two large storage units, both delivered vacant. Very desirable neighborhood with numerous restaurants, bars, cafes, and a weekly farmers' market on Clement Street. 98 Walk Score! Great investment or owner/user opportunity! Some images have been virtually staged to highlight the true potential of rooms and spaces in the home."
  },
